    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+, Mark of Shadow Feat)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase one ability score of your choice by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Improved Intuition.</strong> When you use the Cunning Intuition benefit of your Mark of Shadow feat, you can roll 1d6 instead of 1d4.</p><p><strong>Improved Shadow.</strong> When you use the Shape Shadows benefit of your Mark of Shadow feat to cast Invisibility without a spell slot, you cast it as its level 3 version.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-bR9I3kJRGAH0BDxg\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Improved Intuition: change the bonus of the <em>Cunning Intuition</em> effect of your Mark of Shadow feat from 1d4 to 1d6.</p></section>",
